<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it started coverage of Rockwell International Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 59-7/8.</p>
